@startuml seq-uc5-submit-application
title UC5 Submit an Application: sequence (success path)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

actor Adopter
participant "ApplicationNavigator" as Nav
participant "SubmitApplicationView" as View
participant "SubmitApplicationController" as Controller
participant "SubmitApplicationInteractor\n<<SubmitApplicationInputBoundary>>" as Interactor
participant "FilePetDataAccessObject\n<<SubmitApplicationPetDataAccessInterface>>" as PetDAO
participant "FileApplicationDataAccessObject\n<<SubmitApplicationDataAccessInterface>>" as AppDAO
participant "Application" as App
participant "SubmitApplicationPresenter\n<<SubmitApplicationOutputBoundary>>" as Presenter
participant "SubmitApplicationViewModel" as VM

Adopter -> Nav : chooses to apply for a pet\n(after logging in)
Nav -> VM : set adopter, pet id and pet name
Nav -> View : open the application form\n(through ViewManagerModel)
Adopter -> View : fills in the form, submits
View -> Controller : execute(adopterId, petId, housingType,\npetExperience, householdMembers, contactInfo, note)
Controller -> Interactor : execute(new SubmitApplicationInputData(...))

Interactor -> PetDAO : isAvailable(petId)
PetDAO --> Interactor : true
Interactor -> AppDAO : hasActiveApplication(adopterId, petId)
AppDAO --> Interactor : false
Interactor -> PetDAO : getPetName(petId)
PetDAO --> Interactor : "Mochi"
create App
Interactor -> App : new Application(..., status = PENDING)
Interactor -> AppDAO : save(application)
AppDAO -> AppDAO : write applications JSON file

Interactor -> Presenter : prepareSuccessView(\nnew SubmitApplicationOutputData(id, "Mochi"))
Presenter -> VM : state.setSuccessMessage(...)\nnotifyStateChanged()
VM -> View : stateChanged()
View --> Adopter : "Your application for Mochi was submitted."

note over Interactor, Presenter
  Failure paths call prepareFailView(message) instead:
  not logged in, pet not available, already applied,
  missing required field, pet name or save failed.
end note

@enduml
